# task-state.mmd — 任务状态机

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending
    pending --> in_progress: PATCH /tasks/{id} state=in_progress
    in_progress --> completed: PATCH state=completed + actual_minutes
    in_progress --> abandoned: PATCH state=abandoned + abandoned_reason
    pending --> abandoned: 任务从未启动就被放弃
    pending --> expired: 超过 expires_at
    in_progress --> expired: 超过 expires_at
    completed --> [*]
    abandoned --> [*]
    expired --> [*]
```

## 合法转移矩阵

| From | To | 触发条件 | 副作用 |
|---|---|---|---|
| pending | in_progress | PATCH state=in_progress | task.started_at 写入 |
| in_progress | completed | PATCH state=completed + actual_minutes | task.completed_at + actual_minutes |
| in_progress | abandoned | PATCH + abandoned_reason | task.abandoned_at + abandoned_reason |
| pending | abandoned | PATCH + abandoned_reason | task.abandoned_at |
| pending/in_progress | expired | 后台 cron job（每 5 分钟） | task.expires_at = now() |

## 非法转移

| 尝试 | 响应 |
|---|---|
| completed → any | 409 STATE_TASK_INVALID_TRANSITION |
| abandoned → any | 409 |
| expired → any | 409 |
| * → pending | 409 |
| completed → abandoned（事后改"我其实没完成"） | 不允许（设计选择，避免统计污染） |

## 校验位置

- Service：`services/task.py::assert_task_transition()`
- Repository：写入前再校验一次 version（乐观锁）

